'''''Envision a Rose Forthcoming''''' is an [[Adventure Mission]] on [[Penacony]].

==Steps==
# Consult the shopkeeper Cocona
# Use the record to enter Cocona's inner world
# Listen to what Clockie has to share
# Complete Cocona's Emo Dial
# Seek assistance from Giovanna the dream nurse
# Return to Cocona
# Retrieve the record Cocona lost
# Return the record to Cocona
# Listen to what Clockie has to share
# Find Cocona
# Ask Giovanna about Cocona's situation
# Return to the store to search for Cocona

