===Seek assistance from Giovanna the dream nurse{{subst:void|<!--203010104-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=The Reverie (Reality)|update|Cocona seems to have fallen into an abnormal mental state after she regained the mood of sorrow. Giovanna, the dream nurse at the hotel in reality, should be able to provide aid.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Obtain {{Предмет|Soulheal Special Mix|20|x=1}})

;(Talk to Giovanna)
:'''Giovanna:''' If you've just woken up from a dream, remember &mdash; this is reality.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Miss Cocona's not feeling well.
:'''Giovanna:''' Cocona? Oh, that luxury goods shop owner... What's wrong with her?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} She suddenly became very depressed.
::'''Giovanna:''' A common symptom. Looks like her old problem is acting up again.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It feels like she's become somewhat dazed.
::'''Giovanna:''' Ah... probably side effects from the prior treatment.
:'''Giovanna:''' I recall that she received special treatment not too long ago... Did something happen again to upset her?
:'''Giovanna:''' She has a decent job and great income, but is always plagued by such problems &mdash; it really baffles me.
:Giovanna nonchalantly continues working on whatever she has on hand as if it isn't the first time she has encountered this problem.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is Miss Cocona ill?
::'''Giovanna:''' High-intensity work will severely burden one's mental well-being. Perhaps she's too stressed at work? Over time, that would eventually cause depression.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What sort of treatment did you give her?
:'''Giovanna:''' The relevant personnel have already "handled" her emotions accordingly. She should have already forgotten all the unhappy memories. Conversely, forgetfulness, sleepiness, and dulled reactions are unavoidable side effects.
:'''Giovanna:''' Please forgive me for not being able to reveal too many details regarding the "treatment." It's a rule set by The Family.
:'''Giovanna:''' Thank you for informing me of Miss Cocona's recent situation. I will dispatch people to deliver more of the "special drink" to her.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Special drink?
:'''Giovanna:''' Ah, it's a very special recipe of SoulGlad, specially prepared for those like Cocona &mdash; a special drink unique in the Dreamscapes.
:'''Giovanna:''' Drink it within the Dreamscape and she will temporarily forget her troubles and suppress those negative emotions, allowing her to properly focus on her work and lead a normal life.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let me deliver it to her then.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I can deliver it quicker for you.
:'''Giovanna:''' You mean...
:'''Giovanna:''' I understand. I'll give the special drink to you then. Please deliver it to Miss Cocona.
:'''Giovanna:''' You're such a helpful Dreamchaser. I've met many guests from all walks of life &mdash; those with character comparable to yours are few and far between.
:'''Giovanna:''' I'll be troubling you with this matter then. Just as well, I have other guests to look after right now.
:Giovanna is visibly pleased that she can end this conversation quickly. She turns away and busies herself with her many tasks.
{{Dialogue End}}

