===Ask Giovanna about Cocona's situation{{subst:void|<!--203010115-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=The Reverie (Reality)|update|You have returned from Cocona's inner world, only to find that she is nowhere to be found. Giovanna the dream nurse may know something.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Giovanna)
:'''Giovanna:''' If you've just woken up from a dream, remember &mdash; this is reality.
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} I can't find Cocona.
::'''Giovanna:''' Can't find her? You mean...
::'''Giovanna:''' Ah... I see.
::'''Giovanna:''' Don't be too upset. Stuff like this happens all the time in the Dreamscape.
::'''Giovanna:''' Some give themselves completely to beautiful dreams, and toss away unneeded distractions. There are also few &mdash; like Cocona &mdash; who can never really blend in.
::'''Giovanna:''' Thank you for the news. I will handle the subsequent affairs. I hope this matter won't affect your mood during your stay here.
::'''Giovanna:''' Oh, that's right... That store can't be left empty. I'll contact the Alfalfa Family to have someone take over the store.
::'''Giovanna:''' Please don't worry. The Family will ensure that your shopping experience at the Golden Hour will not be inconvenienced.
:{{Диалог}} Please allow me to introduce you to our dream services.
::'''Giovanna:''' Well, "dream" refers to the process of entering the Dreamscape.
::'''Giovanna:''' Each room is equipped with a specialized "Dreampool" to guide our esteemed guests into the Dreamscape.
::'''Giovanna:''' The Family offers the most secure authorized service, along with a flawless dream experience.
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} So, are there "unauthorized" services?
:::'''Giovanna:''' Well, recently, a blue-haired "merchant" has been selling a new type of "affordable and reliable" dreaming device.
:::'''Giovanna:''' Over ten individuals have fallen victim to this scam. The Bloodhounds are investigating, but the suspect remains at large.
:::'''Giovanna:''' Please do not trust any unauthorized dreaming devices such as the "Quantum Shuttle" or the "Sweetdream Drink."
:::'''Giovanna:''' Since the dream structure within Penacony is complex, unauthorized entries may lead to unpredictable consequences.
:::'''Giovanna:''' Each year, we rescue nearly a hundred stowaways, and the costs of their treatment are not covered by insurance.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Is there anything I should keep in mind?
:::'''Giovanna:''' 1. Please keep your mind calm to avoid unusual experiences.
:::'''Giovanna:''' 2. Please ensure that your face is positioned upwards to prevent any risk of drowning in the Dreampool.
:::'''Giovanna:''' 3. Please do not take sleep-aid medication. If you are unable to fall asleep, please contact our staff for assistance.
:::'''Giovanna:''' Please refer to your Dreamscape Pass for instructions.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} If only I could stay in the dream forever.
:::'''Giovanna:''' According to statistics, 86.9% of our guests share the same sentiment as you.
:::'''Giovanna:''' However, as a nurse, I recommend maintaining a minimum of 7 hours of real-world activity time each system month.
:::'''Giovanna:''' Excessive immersion in dreams can lead to negative effects such as cerebellar atrophy, muscle degeneration, and overall deterioration.
:::'''Giovanna:''' In rare cases, prolonged exposure to dreams can cause guests to struggle in differentiating between dreams and reality.
:::'''Giovanna:''' Although the occurrence rate is no higher than 1.5%, it is still a matter of concern.
:::'''Giovanna:''' Therefore... upon waking up from a dream, please remember that you are back in reality.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} That's all for now.
:::'''Giovanna:''' Certainly. I'm always here to assist you.
:{{Диалог|Выход}} Catch you again next time.
::'''Giovanna:''' See you next time. We wish you a pleasant stay in Penacony.
:<!--1-second delay-->
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (Cocona... Where could she have gone?)
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (I have to find her quickly... I hope everything's all right.)
:<!--1-second delay-->
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (Cocona... disappeared?)
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (I hope everything's all right... Why not return to reality and check in with Giovanna.)
{{Dialogue End}}

